{"question": "Cannot clear a checkout's customer note
I have a checkout with an existing customer note, and I want to remove it entirely by setting the note to null. The mutation requires the customer_note argument, so I cannot omit it or pass null — the API rejects my request. I expected to be able to clear the note, perhaps by passing null or leaving the field out. The only workaround is passing an empty string, which doesn't actually remove the stored note.

gold_fqn": "saleor.graphql.checkout.mutations.checkout_customer_note_update.CheckoutCustomerNoteUpdate"}
